:"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"ed3fdeeb458362e8ec2062ccfdb54dabe86146616d3c09971d19582407bead01","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_primary_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"SMOKE-r5-1W口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC501）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服；每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整。","quote_sha256":"27d2c6ee0aba87aa82c6b4686f544814672a29444462cc6ab5bcd626b5ee1fb0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_dose_scheme"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"治疗策略（treatment policy）：无论是否剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。","quote_sha256":"7e7b05f63a8eb9008c2ec9f40fabf5d8ba570e08ef95d1d11b82a437157fa07d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_estimation_target"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_study_periods","es_visit_strategy","es_primary_endpoint","es_dose_scheme","es_estimation_target"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"治疗期及随访","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究治疗期为12周双盲给药期，自第0天随机入组并首次给药起至第12周治疗结束访视（第12周±3天）止。治疗结束后进入安全随访期，持续至末次给药后2周（约第14周）。治疗期内受试者按1:1:1:1随机分配至KZ-sGC501低剂量（2.5 mg）、中剂量（5 mg）、高剂量（10 mg）或匹配安慰剂组，每日晨起随餐口服一次，联合标准GDMT背景治疗。计划访视安排如下：V1为随机入组访视（第0天），完成随机化、首次给药及基线评估；V2为第4周访视，进行疗效与安全性评价；V3为第8周访视，进行疗效与安全性评价；V4为治疗结束访视（第12周±3天），完成主要终点NT-proBNP评价及全面安全性评估；V5为安全随访访视（第14周），确认不良事件转归。每4周随访时评估药物耐受性，按方案规定进行剂量调整。主要终点NT-proBNP在基线、第4周、第8周和第12周采集。分析采用治疗策略（treatment policy），无论是否发生剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组进行分析。","rationale":"治疗期时长、安全随访期、访视编号与时间点、给药方案、剂量水平、主要终点评价时点及分析策略均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。各访视具体评估项目清单（如每次是否均含12导联ECG、肝肾功能、电解质）需医学经理根据安全性终点定义逐项确认。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_548a0e584eee358e","section_number":"7.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:02c8d095eef6644760ca7eff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006040855_7e5e6188","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"提供计划外访视的触发条件（如症状恶化、AE、依从性偏离）、评估项目清单、记录要求及是否影响FAS归属的项目文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_unscheduled_trigger","missing_source_classes":["计划外访视触发条件与评估内容定义","访视操作手册或方案附录"],"target":"7.1.3 计划外访视"}],"heading":"计划外访视","missing_source_classes":["计划外访视触发条件与评估内容定义","访视操作手册或方案附录"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"当前项目已确认研究事实中未包含计划外访视的触发条件、评估内容、记录要求或分析集归属规则。该章节需要项目层面的实施规则文件（如访视操作手册或方案附录）方可形成实质正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_4ca559b168bfe923","section_number":"7.1.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:02c8d095eef6644760ca7eff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006040855_7e5e6188","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"提供研究治疗终止触发条件（AE导致停药、受试者主动退出、研究者判断等）、退出后随访安排、失访定义及处理流程的项目文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_withdrawal_rules","missing_source_classes":["研究治疗终止与退出研究操作规则","失访定义与处理流程"],"target":"7.1.4 研究治疗终止、退出研究及失访处理"}],"heading":"研究治疗终止、退出研究及失访处理","missing_source_classes":["研究治疗终止与退出研究操作规则","失访定义与处理流程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"当前项目已确认研究事实中未包含研究治疗终止的触发条件、退出研究流程、失访定义及处理规则。该章节需要项目层面的实施规则文件方可形成实质正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_6a36fbb1c332b8f7","section_number":"7.1.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:02c8d095eef6644760ca7eff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006040855_7e5e6188","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"ed3fdeeb458362e8ec2062ccfdb54dabe86146616d3c09971d19582407bead01","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_primary_endpoint"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"067b3f77e20da2222b9c91da7106a0b612b21542c62f4e68cae8bb2ae7c09367","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_stat_strategy"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"治疗策略（treatment policy）：无论是否剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。","quote_sha256":"7e7b05f63a8eb9008c2ec9f40fabf5d8ba570e08ef95d1d11b82a437157fa07d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_estimation_target"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_primary_endpoint","es_stat_strategy","es_estimation_target"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"提供次要终点具体清单（如KCCQ、6MWT、NT-proBNP绝对变化等）、各终点评价时点及预先层级顺序的项目文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_secondary_endpoints","missing_source_classes":["次要终点具体清单及层级顺序","各次要终点评价时点"],"target":"7.2 有效性评估"}],"heading":"有效性评估","missing_source_classes":["次要终点具体清单及层级顺序","各次要终点评价时点"],"proposal_text":"本研究主要有效性终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化，评价时间点为基线、第4周、第8周和第12周。主要分析采用全分析集（FAS），以ANCOVA方法（基线校正）比较各剂量组与安慰剂组的NT-proBNP百分比变化，并检验剂量-反应趋势。分析采用治疗策略（treatment policy），无论是否发生剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组进行分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。安全性终点包括不良事件与严重不良事件发生率、症状性低血压与体位性低血压、生命体征（血压、心率）、肝肾功能及电解质实验室指标、12导联心电图，安全性数据采用描述统计。次要终点按预先设定的层级顺序进行分析。","rationale":"主要终点定义、评价时点、FAS、ANCOVA方法、治疗策略、安全性终点类别及次要终点层级分析策略均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。次要终点具体清单（如KCCQ、6MWT、NT-proBNP绝对变化等）、各次要终点评价时点及层级顺序尚未在已确认事实中完整列出，需医学经理确认后方可补入。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_03ccded4f7df5a75","section_number":"7.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:02c8d095eef6644760ca7eff","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"6595bc7ef0ed329672993460cd437464b684de9387a82c012fa415350eacf016","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_83e9420f4f9f88b3:full-draft:02c8d095eef6644760ca7eff","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:02c8d095eef6644760ca7eff","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:9f14082f8ca9ba3e77613e4c62ca77cff3c65d122f60d56d8ea6c8a1ffab8aa1:02c8d095eef6644760ca7eff","text_sha256":"6595bc7ef0ed329672993460cd437464b684de9387a82c012fa415350eacf016"},{"content_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","text_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d"}]}